<#task_manager> <https://schema.org/name> "Task manager";
    <https://schema.org/description> "A task manager helps you organise a list of tasks that you want to track. This includes adding new tasks, prioritising them, and marking them as done.".
    
<#booking_appointments> schema:name "Booking appointments"; schema:description "Booking appointments involves scheduling a meeting with someone for a specific task, considering both of your calendars.".
<#kanban> schema:name "Kanban"; schema:description "Kanban helps progress tasks along a workflow.".
<#event_reminders> schema:name "Event reminders"; schema:description "Event reminders give you with peace of mind that you'll remember tasks, and reduce mental load required to keep track of them.".
<#focus> schema:name "Focus";schema:url <https://github.com/NoelDeMartin/solid-focus>;schema:description "Provides task lists. Notes functionality allows the user to make connections and include links associated with the task.".
